### 🔹 Obtener todos los posts
GET http://localhost:3000/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 🔹 Crear un nuevo post
POST http://localhost:3000/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Mi primer post",
  "content": "Contenido de prueba",
  "published": true
}

###

### 🔹 Obtener post por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 🔹 Borrar post por ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 🔹 Ver comentarios del post (por ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/comments/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 🔹 Agregar comentario al post (por ID)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/comments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Gran post, gracias!"
}

###

### 🔹 Crear nuevo usuario
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "juanito",
  "email": "juan@email.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

### 🔹 Obtener todos los usuarios
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

### 🔹 Login con passport (authRoutes)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "juanito",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

### 🔹 Cerrar sesión (authRoutes)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/logout
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 🔹 Obtener usuario actual (authRoutes)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/me
Content-Type: application/json

###

###